cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "MALDIPixelQuant"
type: software
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-19"
authors:
  - family-names: "Alderden"
    given-names: "Wessel"
repository-code: "https://github.com/WesAld/FullPixel-MSI-Quant"
url: "https://github.com/WesAld/FullPixel-MSI-Quant"
license: "MIT"
abstract: >-
  A local R Shiny workflow for full-pixel MALDI mass spectrometry imaging
  quantification from aligned MZmine features, with Raw, spectrum-sum, RMS,
  and Median intensity strategies, optional biological-replicate jackknife
  analysis, and publication-ready quantitative exports.
keywords:
  - MALDI-MSI
  - mass spectrometry imaging
  - metabolomics
  - MZmine
  - Shiny
  - spectrum-sum normalization
